Infer an augmented assignment on an instance of a builtin mutable container
(``list``, ``set``, ``dict``, ``bytearray``) or of one of their subclasses as that
instance, since their in-place operators mutate and return the same object.
Previously the result was uninferable, so an attribute assigned to ``self`` after
``self |= other`` in a ``set`` subclass was not recorded on the class and pylint
reported ``no-member`` for it.

Closes pylint-dev/pylint#10031
